{"id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-supervaluation.md","title":"超赋值逻辑","display":"df-supervaluation — 超赋值逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-supervaluation","aliases":["91-df-supervaluation","91-df-supervaluation-logic"],"display":"df-supervaluation — 超赋值逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-partial-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-supervaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-supervaluation</span><span>91-df-supervaluation-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supervaluation — 超赋值逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d412b656b2bbda0\" href=\"?note=0d412b656b2bbda0\" title=\"91-df-partial-logic\">91-df-partial-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-supervaluation-—-超赋值逻辑-$\\mathrm{SV}$\">df-supervaluation — 超赋值逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SV}\">\\(\\mathrm{SV}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (对象语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (真值集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span> (部分评估)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (服从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 经典递归语义的二值句子评估集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n(v(\\psi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\psi)=v(\\psi))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n(v(\\psi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\psi)=v(\\psi))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v\">\\(\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v\\)</span>：相对于部分评估 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的超赋值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\">\\(w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 是保持全部已确定值的经典精确化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超赋值逻辑的含义：\n句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当在所有允许的经典精确化中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>都真；\n句子是假的，当且仅当在所有这些精确化中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>都假。非空条件排除\n“对空精确化类全称量化”导致真假同时成立的退化情形。</p>\n<p>超赋值的特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过&quot;超&quot;所有经典扩展定义真值</li>\n<li>某些句子在所有扩展中稳定为真或假</li>\n<li>间隙句子在不同扩展中真值不同</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超赋值与强Kleene的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>强Kleene</th>\n<th>超赋值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (说谎者)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\lor \\neg \\lambda\">\\(\\lambda \\lor \\neg \\lambda\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>（超真）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\land \\neg \\lambda\">\\(\\lambda \\land \\neg \\lambda\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span>（超假）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>关键区别：超赋值保留更多经典有效性。</p>\n<p>超赋值的优点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保持经典逻辑的有效式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\lor \\neg \\varphi\">\\(\\varphi \\lor \\neg \\varphi\\)</span>在超赋值中有效</li>\n<li>更接近经典逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超赋值的缺点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真值定义依赖所有扩展</li>\n<li>计算复杂度更高</li>\n<li>不满足组合性（真值不能从分量直接计算）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-supervaluation-—-超赋值逻辑-$\\mathrm{SV}$","text":"df-supervaluation — 超赋值逻辑 $\\mathrm{SV}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-partial-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-partial-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{2}(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n(v(\\psi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\psi)=v(\\psi))\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&\\text{若 }\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L}_v","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\lor \\neg \\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\land \\neg \\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\lor \\neg \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2520,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a986179bb85417f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb495d7446e8fef8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disqu